{
  "bookId": "rewind-6",
  "id": "chapter-28",
  "sections": [
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "sourceId": "3850001",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "四处……一片漆黑……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3850002",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "又陷入到新的回忆之中了吗？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3850003",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "我究竟，在什么地方？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3850004",
          "sourceType": 3,
          "text": "优纪……优纪！",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3850005",
          "sourceType": 3,
          "text": "优纪前辈……请醒一醒，快醒一醒！",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3850006",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "好熟悉好亲切的声音……可是为什么，我却想不起这些声音的名字……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3850007",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "光亮——",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3850008",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "啊啊啊——是光亮！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3850009",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "和江……花迦！是大家！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3850010",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "花迦",
          "text": "嗯嗯！前辈！这……真是太好了！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3850011",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "岩田和江",
          "text": "优纪……真的是你吗？谢天谢地，你总算回到我的身边了！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3850012",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "是大家，是最熟悉的大家！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3850013",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "情不自禁想要流泪呢，可是，手办怎么会有眼泪呢。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3850014",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "优纪一个人在黑漆漆的履带中，好担心、好害怕！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3850015",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "但是只要想着主人，想着大家，即使是最黑暗的日子，我就能看到前面的光亮。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3850016",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玲",
          "text": "好啦好了啦，肉麻得……鸡皮疙瘩全都要起来了。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3850017",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "真田幸村",
          "text": "这一刻！决定了，不管发生什么，几位女生，我一定会好好保护你们的！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3850018",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "你们是……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3850019",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "哇呀呀！可恶……一部分记忆丢失掉了，对不起！优纪没有办法想起你们的名字！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3850020",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "岩田和江",
          "text": "别自责了，你的经历，我们都感同身受。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3850021",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "岩田和江",
          "text": "什么也不用讲，什么也不用说，现在就这样，紧紧地抱住我吧。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3850022",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "阿撒兹勒",
          "text": "真是一幕，温馨感人的戏码啊。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3850023",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "你……你是？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3850024",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "阿撒兹勒",
          "text": "……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3850025",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "我想起你的名字了……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3850026",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "原来它们，一直都藏在那些真真切切，但早已遗忘的回忆之中，",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3850027",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "你是……你就是……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        }
      ],
      "id": "detail-201",
      "sourceRefs": [
        {
