        }
      ],
      "title": "#4 隐匿的真相"
    },
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "sourceId": "3890001",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "对你来说，身边的人究竟……意味着什么？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3890002",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "它们，只是达成你一切目的的工具吗？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3890003",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "所以，对于它们的死活，你可以完全不管不顾！甚至……甚至就像那时一样！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3890004",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "阿撒兹勒",
          "text": "……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3890005",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "什、什么意思？！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3890006",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "我不会再像那时一样无措了，我……会阻止你的！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3890007",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "阿撒兹勒",
          "text": "真不敢相信这样的话，是出自你口。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3890008",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "阿撒兹勒",
          "text": "提尔。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3890009",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "提尔",
          "text": "主人……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3890010",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "阿撒兹勒",
          "text": "你胆敢违抗，我的指令？！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3890011",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "提尔",
          "text": "是，遵照主人的意志，行事。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3890012",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "你……你要做什么？！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3890013",
          "sourceType": 3,
          "text": "巨龙振翅而飞，俯向大地，随即，剧烈的吐息从它的嘴里喷出。",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3890014",
          "sourceType": 3,
          "text": "燃烧的烈焰将地面之上的众手办……全部包围，就像过去的，那个情景。",
          "type": "narration"
        }
      ],
      "id": "detail-205",
      "sourceRefs": [
        {
          "bundle": "exceldata",
          "rowIds": [
            3890001,
            3890002,
